  "title": "lean-trominoes",
  "excerpt": "Lean formalization of [*Undecidability of Tiling with a Tromino*](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.07906) by the MIT--ULB CompGeom Group, Zachary Abel, Hugo Akitaya, Lily Chung, Erik D. Demaine, Jenny Diomidova, Della Hendrickson, Stefan Langerman, and Jayson Lynch. The working paper is included as [PDF](trominoes.pdf) and [source](trominoes.texlish). Use the checked-in source as the reference for theorem statements and proofs in this formalization."
 },
